#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-export-descriptor.md:1
#: 2363c9489d4f44f9ae133ef20f7ebb2e
msgid "导出结构描述符（Export structure descriptor）"
msgstr "Export structure descriptor"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-export-descriptor.md:3
#: 8c9472b2c3b1428982a9f7cafc1597a3
msgid "界面按钮：`导出结构描述符`。"
msgstr "Toolbar action: `Export structure descriptor`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-export-descriptor.md:5
#: c2276f9323d9480ea42a79477d060dd8
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-export-descriptor.md:7
#: 9e30639b409e4845aad685bc4d608c02
#
msgid ""
"把**当前选中结构**的描述符导出为文本文件，供外部降维、聚类或覆盖分析使用。先选中结构再点击； "
"没有选中任何结构时只会提示，不会生成文件。这个操作不会改变当前数据、选择集或模型。"
msgstr "Exports the descriptors of the **currently selected structures** to a text file for external dimensionality reduction, clustering, or coverage analysis. Select structures first; with nothing selected, NepTrainKit only shows a message and writes no file. This does not change the data, selection, or model."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-export-descriptor.md:10
#: ad8ed343fcc24831a80a65826eb90971
msgid "完整的分类导出和绘图流程见[描述符分布绘图示例](../example/Plot-descriptor.md)。"
msgstr "See the [descriptor distribution plot example](../example/Plot-descriptor.md) for a complete export-and-plot workflow."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-export-descriptor.md:12
#: de2bb0927d4f4fa19432f38b61eb0948
msgid "输出"
msgstr "Output"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7327
#: 17513335f6eb4672a2e5640fe0c1ead0
msgid "导出范围：只导出当前选中的结构；没有选中时提示后不生成文件。"
msgstr "Scope: only the selected structures are exported; with nothing selected, a message is shown and no file is written."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7328
#: e00748a84acd401ba5dd2df618d82324
#
msgid "默认文件名：`export_descriptor_data.out`。"
msgstr "Default filename: `export_descriptor_data.out`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:7329
#: e6bc1e0fe4e945b7b7b2a757e2f33441
msgid "文件格式：制表符分隔的文本，每行一个结构；前两列是描述符图上的坐标，数据中有能量时第三列是每原子能量。"
msgstr "Format: tab-separated text with one structure per row; the first two columns are descriptor-plot coordinates, and the third column is energy per atom when energies are available."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-export-descriptor.md:19
#: dfebc37eea3b476fadc79b330eced729
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-export-descriptor.md:21
#: 57f7f4870f1746dba0f8270357e34697
#
msgid ""
"等待后台任务结束，再确认目标文件存在且行数等于选中的结构数。描述符来自当前活动模型； 切换 `nep.txt` "
"后重新导出，不能把不同模型产生的描述符直接当作同一坐标空间。"
msgstr "Wait for the background task to finish, then confirm that the file exists and its row count equals the number of selected structures. Descriptors come from the active model; re-export after switching `nep.txt`, because descriptors from different models do not share a coordinate space."

#~ msgid "执行结果：后台导出描述符。"
#~ msgstr "Result: export descriptors in the background."
